"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T05:57:52-07:00","id":948543,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=948325#post948325\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If that's the case, my response is simply &amp;quot;Grow up.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div> Never, no fun in that!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T06:06:50-07:00","id":948549,"title":"","content":"Anyways moving on from my cheesy sense of humour, I wonder how they will balance a game if PCs choose wildly different powerll levels like, one PC is being hunted by a group even less scary then the smurfs, and another being hunted by the US government or the Martian Human alliance. <br /> <br /> The US government could end up killing the Deviant hunted by smurfs while targeting the other Deviant, and that Deviant could solve the first ones problems by just killing all the smurfs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T06:23:16-07:00","id":948558,"title":"","content":"I imagine the solution to that is discuss it before the game starts and get everyone on the same page.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T07:41:10-07:00","id":948602,"title":"","content":"speculating:<br /> <br /> I imagine that in the X axis - Origin - We:<br /> <br /> Self-transformation, Crash Conspiracy Human, Desviant, contamination, Curse / Punishment, Supernatural and unknown.<br /> <br /> And in the Y axis - Clade - We:<br /> <br /> Science (Technology and Mutation), Magic (Witchcraft and Mysticism), Alchemy, Paranormality, Replication (attempt to copy a larger model, recreating the rite of creation of the Mummies) and Improvement (you were a minor template, or hunter before) .<br /> <br /> And the Z axis would be more specific Y axis, oh yes, with Cyborg, Psychic).<br /> <br /> And Conspiracies would be antagonists, the coterie and merits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T07:59:30-07:00","id":948611,"title":"","content":"You know. I hope they have a axis for something like Sin-Eater archetypes. Both the splat Axis we have so far are innate traits fixed when you become a Deviant. An additional splat representing your charachter's choice in how they react would be a good addition.<br /> <br /> I suppose we already have that in Renigade or loyalist. But what other options might there be?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T08:05:10-07:00","id":948615,"title":"","content":"The agenda of each Desviant seems so unique priori do not see a social axis. Up because I believe that a Loyalist associated with a particular group may be better off with an opposite rebel group, with a legalistic another conspiracy than it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T16:28:34-07:00","id":948924,"title":"","content":"To add another thing Deviant could do, I could see the Dollhouses from <i>Dollhouse</i> being a Deviant Org, with the Actives (especially Alpha and Echo) being Deviants.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T17:28:04-07:00","id":948957,"title":"","content":"As odd as this sounds I hope Deviant eats the Possessed from Inferno.<br /> <br /> I can see a conspiracy doing a rite that causes a human to become one of the possessed and the risk of their powers being the cause of their doom fits both gamelines. Perhaps a Demon possessed Clade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T18:26:02-07:00","id":948979,"title":"","content":"A &quot;possession&quot; Clade would be good, but I think Charlaquin has told us to get off the talk about Deviant &quot;eating&quot; other splats. And besides, Inferno actually has a very well defined and appropriate niche that it fits into, so I'd rather we didn't do it in. <br /> <br /> Remember, Deviants can overlap a lot with minor templates, such as Claimed, demon-possessed, and so on. The difference (from what Dave has told us) is that being a Deviant is a much more complete change that fundamentally changes a person's essence. You could totally say that a Deviant began as a fiend-possessed (as an aside, I like the idea of calling Inferno demons &quot;fiends&quot; to avoid confusion) and that the possession caused the &quot;soul breaking&quot; that Dave described as being the defining aspect of a Deviant. <br /> <br /> Now, you could note that technically vampires, mages, changelings, mummies, beasts, and sin-eaters could be Deviants, since it's an umbrella term, and that's something that would be fun to play with- maybe those beings are essentially types of Deviants that became relatively stable and common, due to greater supernatural forces being responsible for their change?<br /> <br /> But back to Clades, I'm actually really hoping that there's a &quot;Symbiont&quot; Clade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T18:40:26-07:00","id":948991,"title":"","content":"Did anyone else ever see Outsider: the Calling, way back in the day? It was a doomed fangame about playing individuals unwillingly changed by the important critters of the Cthulhu Mythos, and while it folded pretty quickly after the initial rush, I feel like it could very well live again in Deviant's skin. <br /> <br /> Pouring one out for the Star-spawned Savants, Young of the Thousand, Shepherds of the Silver Key, Scions of the Yellow Scion, and Courtiers of the Black Pharaoh.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T19:08:39-07:00","id":949008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=948991#post948991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did anyone else ever see Outsider: the Calling, way back in the day? It was a doomed fangame about playing individuals unwillingly changed by the important critters of the Cthulhu Mythos, and while it folded pretty quickly after the initial rush, I feel like it could very well live again in Deviant's skin. <br /> <br /> Pouring one out for the Star-spawned Savants, Young of the Thousand, Shepherds of the Silver Key, Scions of the Yellow Scion, and Courtiers of the Black Pharaoh.</div> </div> </div> </div>See, the problem I had with Outsider was that it was just kind of awkward to throw the Cthulhu mythos into a setting that already had the Abyss, the Idigam, and the True Fae. I think the better way to handle it would be to homebrew Cthulhu or Yog-sothoth as Abyssal entities or Fae or Idigam.<br /> <br /> &quot;Chosen&quot; could be a splat, canon or homebrew, representing Deviants who get their powers via being altered by some sort of supernatural entity. Technically, it could be either kind of splat: either you got your powers when a supernatural patron entity chose you to be its &quot;champion&quot;, or &quot;champion of eldritch forces&quot; could be a Clade. This is getting me pumped to speculate about splats. X-Splats are pretty well described, but I believe we only have two Clades (I know Dave explicitly said &quot;cyborg&quot; was one of them). So what're you predicting for the others? I've already thrown Symbiont into the ring as my prediction, but &quot;Serum&quot; could be another one. &quot;Virus&quot; works too- and that'd be Pathogen covered as well. <br /> <br /> And you know I'm one hundred percent behind your desire for a Blue Book supplement about cults.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 08-11-2016, 10:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T19:17:23-07:00","id":949016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=949008#post949008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> See, the problem I had with Outsider was that it was just kind of awkward to throw the Cthulhu mythos into a setting that already had the Abyss, the Idigam, and the True Fae. I think the better way to handle it would be to homebrew Cthulhu or Yog-sothoth as Abyssal entities or Fae or Idigam.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;Chosen&amp;quot; could be a splat, canon or homebrew, representing Deviants who get their powers via being altered by some sort of supernatural entity. Technically, it could be either kind of splat: either you got your powers when a supernatural patron entity chose you to be its &amp;quot;champion&amp;quot;, or &amp;quot;champion of eldritch forces&amp;quot; could be a Clade. This is getting me pumped to speculate about splats. X-Splats are pretty well described, but I believe we only have two Clades (I know Dave explicitly said &amp;quot;cyborg&amp;quot; was one of them). So what're you predicting for the others? I've already thrown Symbiont into the ring as my prediction, but &amp;quot;Serum&amp;quot; could be another one. &amp;quot;Virus&amp;quot; works too- and that'd be Pathogen covered as well. <br /> <br /> And you know I'm one hundred percent behind your desire for a Blue Book supplement about cults.</div> </div> </div> </div>The first thing on my plate once Scion 2e comes out will be homebrewing up a Lovecraftian Pantheon and (if necessary) Cult rules as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T23:40:14-07:00","id":949157,"title":"","content":"Kind of bummed that Deviant has a mechanic that punishes asocial or introverted behavior by turning your character into the Fly. I mean, its a rpg, so your character being social with at least the characters at the table is kind of mandatory, and the lone wolf isn't usually a constructive character archetype, but still, I'd kind of prefer that kind of slip into inhumanity to be measured by outright undeniably evil and monstrous acts and not just for being a loner.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1675-weirdboyz","name":"Weirdboyz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1675_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"212"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T00:30:26-07:00","id":949170,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=948991#post948991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did anyone else ever see Outsider: the Calling, way back in the day? It was a doomed fangame about playing individuals unwillingly changed by the important critters of the Cthulhu Mythos, and while it folded pretty quickly after the initial rush, I feel like it could very well live again in Deviant's skin. <br /> <br /> Pouring one out for the Star-spawned Savants, Young of the Thousand, Shepherds of the Silver Key, Scions of the Yellow Scion, and Courtiers of the Black Pharaoh.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ditto with Pathogen. Both were interesting, but never got fully developed. Deep Ones and ATP Zombies will make excellent Deviants.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T01:37:42-07:00","id":949190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weirdboyz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=949157#post949157\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Kind of bummed that Deviant has a mechanic that punishes asocial or introverted behavior by turning your character into the Fly. I mean, its a rpg, so your character being social with at least the characters at the table is kind of mandatory, and the lone wolf isn't usually a constructive character archetype, but still, I'd kind of prefer that kind of slip into inhumanity to be measured by outright undeniably evil and monstrous acts and not just for being a loner.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't forget you can reverse things by remaining loyal to the Conspiracy, that should make lone wolves far more plausible.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=948991#post948991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did anyone else ever see Outsider: the Calling, way back in the day? It was a doomed fangame about playing individuals unwillingly changed by the important critters of the Cthulhu Mythos, and while it folded pretty quickly after the initial rush, I feel like it could very well live again in Deviant's skin.<br /> <br /> Pouring one out for the Star-spawned Savants, Young of the Thousand, Shepherds of the Silver Key, Scions of the Yellow Scion, and Courtiers of the Black Pharaoh.</div> </div> </div> </div>While not precisely the Chuthlu mythos, I've already mentioned in Leviathan that Rituals used to bless your followers or pawns with power sometimes &quot;deviate far from the usual effects&quot;. If you want to play a Lovecraftian occultist who stole power from a Leviathan, and now is running from a cult that's trying to recover it, be my guest <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <hr /><br /> On an unrealted note. As just a tiny bit of wild speculation. Anyone else think the Orphan Black like ability to impersonate each other and the Sense8 ability to telpathicaly swap bodies is the same Variation at different levels?<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Save</span></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 08-12-2016, 04:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T10:59:58-07:00","id":949417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=949190#post949190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don't forget you can reverse things by remaining loyal to the Conspiracy, that should make lone wolves far more plausible.<br /> <br /> While not precisely the Chuthlu mythos, I've already mentioned in Leviathan that Rituals used to bless your followers or pawns with power sometimes &amp;quot;deviate far from the usual effects&amp;quot;. If you want to play a Lovecraftian occultist who stole power from a Leviathan, and now is running from a cult that's trying to recover it, be my guest <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <hr /><br /> On an unrealted note. As just a tiny bit of wild speculation. Anyone else think the Orphan Black like ability to impersonate each other and the Sense8 ability to telpathicaly swap bodies is the same Variation at different levels?<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Save</span></div></div> </div> </div> </div>...now I do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T13:57:48-07:00","id":949513,"title":"","content":"I can use this game to run Worm.<br /> <br /> Neato.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T19:52:33-07:00","id":949736,"title":"","content":"&quot;But back to Clades, I'm actually really hoping that there's a &quot;Symbiont&quot; Clade.&quot;<br /> <br /> I like the idea of a Symbiont Clade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T16:18:30-07:00","id":950292,"title":"","content":"Little late to the conversation, but after reading those first page spoilers I just had to express my sheer giddy anticipation.<br /> <br /> To my eyes Deviant is looking a lot like Mage: The Ascension. Not in the setting, or themes, but in the sheer breadth of potential. Allow me to explain: To me, the best quality of Ascension is just how much you can do with it. Basically any character concept vaguely aligned with the concept of &quot;consciously performs miracles&quot; is embraced and enabled by Ascension. I love that, and I'm getting the same vibe from Deviant. Reading just that little spoiler I must have run through a dozen or more brief character concepts, all different, and all seemingly embraced by the narrative and system.<br /> <br /> For someone like me, who loves the sandbox above all else, Deviant looks to be a god send and (fingers crossed) a game I that will bend to meet my every need. Two thumbs up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T17:29:16-07:00","id":950325,"title":"","content":"Semiformed image: a Deviant whose abilities come from a suit of powered armor...and whose body is covered in scars and cybernetics and access ports that allow the suit to connect to them and interface with their mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T21:18:46-07:00","id":950430,"title":"","content":"So your saying Darth Vader is a deviant","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7525-quinn-h","name":"Quinn H.","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T22:30:29-07:00","id":950444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Quinn H.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=950430#post950430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So your saying Darth Vader is a deviant</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes.<br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">characters</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T23:13:50-07:00","id":950457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=949008#post949008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> See, the problem I had with Outsider was that it was just kind of awkward to throw the Cthulhu mythos into a setting that already had the Abyss, the Idigam, and the True Fae. I think the better way to handle it would be to homebrew Cthulhu or Yog-sothoth as Abyssal entities or Fae or Idigam.<br /> <br /> &quot;Chosen&quot; could be a splat, canon or homebrew, representing Deviants who get their powers via being altered by some sort of supernatural entity. Technically, it could be either kind of splat: either you got your powers when a supernatural patron entity chose you to be its &quot;champion&quot;, or &quot;champion of eldritch forces&quot; could be a Clade. This is getting me pumped to speculate about splats. X-Splats are pretty well described, but I believe we only have two Clades (I know Dave explicitly said &quot;cyborg&quot; was one of them). So what're you predicting for the others? I've already thrown Symbiont into the ring as my prediction, but &quot;Serum&quot; could be another one. &quot;Virus&quot; works too- and that'd be Pathogen covered as well.<br /> <br /> And you know I'm one hundred percent behind your desire for a Blue Book supplement about cults.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Whereas the Deep Space is almost empty, I see nothing to prevent Lovecraftians beings. In fact, it would be the best way to include this environment (and become a typical environment for these things). It would be interesting already have them introduced in order to have a line cultists them in the future.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-14T02:32:00-07:00","id":950485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=950325#post950325\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Semiformed image: a Deviant whose abilities come from a suit of powered armor...and whose body is covered in scars and cybernetics and access ports that allow the suit to connect to them and interface with their mind.</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"http://orig08.deviantart.net/fa24/f/2013/318/1/7/powerarmour_by_mikhailsavier-d6u712u.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-14T09:09:39-07:00","id":950584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Quinn H.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=950430#post950430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So your saying Darth Vader is a deviant</div> </div> </div> </div>Better yet, he's a double-dip Deviant. First, he's indoctrinated into a magic space wizard cult, then he gets turned into an evil space wizard cyborg.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a t