er, Sense8 style? That's just a Variation. Amalgams (name very temp) are when a Deviant used to be more than one person.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I remember a comic I read as a kid where you had 5 teens each with low level psi powers, who could meld physically together to become one massively powerful entity greater than the sum of its parts AS LONG AS 5 teenagers from differing backgrounds and cliques could agree that something absolutely needed to be done (which was, unsurprisingly, a rarity). I'd love to see an advancement of Sense8 (love that show) where the other folks in the pod provide basicly co-processing power to the PoV character and/or Distraction","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5118-perverseness","name":"Perverseness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-11T11:32:58-08:00","id":1015744,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Perverseness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1013349#post1013349\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I remember a comic I read as a kid where you had 5 teens each with low level psi powers, who could meld physically together to become one massively powerful entity greater than the sum of its parts AS LONG AS 5 teenagers from differing backgrounds and cliques could agree that something absolutely needed to be done (which was, unsurprisingly, a rarity). I'd love to see an advancement of Sense8 (love that show) where the other folks in the pod provide basicly co-processing power to the PoV character and/or Distraction</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds like (a deconstruction of) Captain Planet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1424-ghanjrho","name":"GhanjRho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1424_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T08:57:39-08:00","id":1016129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GhanjRho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1015744#post1015744\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sounds like (a deconstruction of) Captain Planet.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Maybe, the series was Psi-Force of the New Universe from Marvel, if anyone was curious- psychic kids were recruited by an Amerindian CIA agent who was involved in a project to find kids with high ESP scores.<br /> <br /> He dies, but becomes the basis of a tulpa that they can generate.<br /> <br /> Although there powers weren't actually the result of some conspiracy it'd easily be fodder for a Deviant game, since basically the entire series was about various conspiracies wanting to use them, until they finally found one they could work with willingly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T13:03:32-08:00","id":1016211,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that sounds like Psi-Force to me too.<br /> <br /> Although the characters weren't necessarily low powered. For a long time they were still learning how to use their powers, however.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T14:46:07-08:00","id":1016255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1013292#post1013292\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can you tell which types of transformation will show in the corebook first? I remember Cyborgs being mentioned</div> </div> </div> </div>If we are going with the five standard, and thinking about general archetypes, my personal take is this: Cybo