altars and buffy as a deviant made through supernatural rituals. Sam Winchester could easily be considered a deviant. You could have a cult which tries to turn the player into a vessel for their god. You could have used occult rituals to try and ascend to godhood or attain immortality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 12-12-2016, 06:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T16:05:20-08:00","id":1016296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1016283#post1016283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We've heard of things like deviants being made on altars and buffy as a deviant made through supernatural rituals. Sam Winchester could easily be considered a deviant. You could have a cult which tries to turn the player into a vessel for their god. You could have used occult rituals to try and ascend to godhood or attain immortality.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;Klaatu, verata... shit&quot;<br /> <br /> (Cue new Deviant)</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T18:26:49-08:00","id":1016346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1016267#post1016267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope we can hear a little more soon about Deviants that don't feel as sci-fi as the inspirational media has been so far.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure if it's canon for all Deviants or not, but a <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?781248-Demon-Intel-Deciphering-Codex-IC-Let-s-Read-of-Horror-Recognition-Guide&amp;p=20662284#post20662284\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer on my own Let's Read</a> implied that at least some Deviants are made via implanting washover from dimensional events. Not sure if that's what you wanted or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T02:14:43-08:00","id":1016464,"title":"","content":"It depends how you define scifi: there's always going to be that edge to it, because even when Variations don't look like physical implants, they're still experiments. Taking something supernatural and trying to apply it to a person, with terrible results.<br /> <br /> Clades are divergence-agnostic. Is an animal/human hybrid, Dr Moreau style, the result of genetic tampering, surgical alteration, a skinwalking ritual gone wrong, a cult worshipping an animal dirty choosing a child as their holy leader, slivers of cursed poached ivory forced into a poacher's flesh as a punishment... It doesn't matter.<br /> <br /> Even cyborgs. Is someone a cyborg because they had experimental implants, or because a machine-worshipping cult did a ritual on them causing metal parts to grow out of them?<br /> <br /> There's a lot of breadth here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T03:02:34-08:00","id":1016474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1016267#post1016267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope we can hear a little more soon about Deviants that don't feel as sci-fi as the inspirational media has been so far.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1016464#post1016464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It depends how you define scifi: there's always going to be that edge to it, because even when Variations don't look like physical implants, they're still experiments. Taking something supernatural and trying to apply it to a person, with terrible results.<br /> <br /> Clades are divergence-agnostic. Is an animal/human hybrid, Dr Moreau style, the result of genetic tampering, surgical alteration, a skinwalking ritual gone wrong, a cult worshipping an animal dirty choosing a child as their holy leader, slivers of cursed poached ivory forced into a poacher's flesh as a punishment... It doesn't matter.<br /> <br /> Even cyborgs. Is someone a cyborg because they had experimental implants, or because a machine-worshipping cult did a ritual on them causing metal parts to grow out of them?<br /> <br /> There's a lot of breadth here.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, it seems all the &quot;Cursed by X to become Y&quot; stuff we've seen so much in horror stories and folklore are prime material for historic Deviants, in contrast to the modern Deviants.<br /> <br /> Aaaaaand we can now be pretty sure that two of the Clades are &quot;animal hybrid&quot; and &quot;cyborg&quot;, right? I wonder what the others are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T05:57:34-08:00","id":1016507,"title":"","content":"So, what you became is more important compared to how you became that. Makes sense to me. It's a good way to keep things neutral.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2964,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","user":"Firanai","date":". 12-13-2016, 10:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T06:38:25-08:00","id":1016518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1016464#post1016464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Clades are divergence-agnostic. Is an animal/human hybrid, Dr Moreau style, the result of genetic tampering, surgical alteration, a skinwalking ritual gone wrong, a cult worshipping an animal dirty choosing a child as their holy leader, slivers of cursed poached ivory forced into a poacher's flesh as a punishment... It doesn't matter.<br /> <br /> Even cyborgs. Is someone a cyborg because they had experimental implants, or because a machine-worshipping cult did a ritual on them causing metal parts to grow out of them?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that's a very effective sell-post, there. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T07:24:47-08:00","id":1016540,"title":"","content":"Dave, you've been outed. Blame RichT or Canada. Either ones good. HMMM poutin, So SO good.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5118-perverseness","name":"Perverseness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T08:11:17-08:00","id":1016556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1016346#post1016346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not sure if it's canon for all Deviants or not, but a <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?781248-Demon-Intel-Deciphering-Codex-IC-Let-s-Read-of-Horror-Recognition-Guide&amp;p=20662284#post20662284\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer on my own Let's Read</a> implied that at least some Deviants are made via implanting washover from dimensional events. Not sure if that's what you wanted or not.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bJust to clarify - I have not read whatever DaveB has put together for Deviant and its setting bible, I don't know the details of what he has planned beyond the same info he's teased to the public, and (insert various other disclaimers here). That's just me spitballing wildly after a particular bit in that chapter of the HRG caused my brain to spark <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Don't take that as anything more than my ramblings.<br /> <br /> \u200bEdit: Specifically, rereading that chapter (I do love the HRG) made me make a connection with THING XYZ I've run in my own games, which in turn made me think 'huh, THING XYZ could actually be meshed into Deviant if my understanding of the teasers so far is correct' and I ran with it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T08:21:04-08:00","id":1016562,"title":"","content":"Has anyone made a site that collected all the spoilers in one place?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxrkv14ojD_TQXU0RBvF33Q\" target=\"_blank\">Fool's Corner Productions</a>: Where we review Video Game, and eventually tabletop RPGs<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/461-kingcarnival","name":"KingCarnival","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar461_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T10:47:48-08:00","id":1016641,"title":"","content":"Ok I had an interesting idea based on what DaveB said about rituals. Ever seen Ju-on? Played Fatal Fram II: Crimson Butterfly? <br /> <br /> Especially with the latter, imagine a the main antagonist actually as a Devient rather than a ghost/spiritual entity. The Towns people call on the connection between twins and focus it all (through a weird effect in the locale: ley lines, spirit hunting grounds, opening the hedge, ambient/old Infrastructure, /shrug) into the twins. This, over the course of generations, infuses that latent psychic power (or something) into the last one remaining creating creating a deviant who wreaks havok on the town in vengeance. <br /> <br /> ... actually, looking at the Fatal Frame 'Antagonist' wiki, pretty much all of them were created due to some ritual or failed ritual to appease some realm/deity or as a way to collect energy from others. I know that they are all Ghost stories but it doesn't take much to swing it into the creation of a Deviant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T10:57:00-08:00","id":1016646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1016464#post1016464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It depends how you define scifi: there's always going to be that edge to it, because even when Variations don't look like physical implants, they're still experiments. Taking something supernatural and trying to apply it to a person, with terrible results.<br /> <br /> Clades are divergence-agnostic. Is an animal/human hybrid, Dr Moreau style, the result of genetic tampering, surgical alteration, a skinwalking ritual gone wrong, a cult worshipping an animal dirty choosing a child as their holy leader, slivers of cursed poached ivory forced into a poacher's flesh as a punishment... It doesn't matter.<br /> <br /> Even cyborgs. Is someone a cyborg because they had experimental implants, or because a machine-worshipping cult did a ritual on them causing metal parts to grow out of them?<br /> <br /> There's a lot of breadth here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are all methods of creating a Deviant completely unique and distinct from each other or is there a common element between them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T11:24:03-08:00","id":1016659,"title":"","content":"Good question. I'd just imagine they're at least somewhat unique.<br /> <br /> If you could manufacture one identical Steve a day, who cares if Steve-701 goes AWOL? There's probably less tension.<br /> <br /> But I suppose that's an entirely valid way of running it, like Blade Runner or Les Mis\u00e9rables. You could just have an individual hunter or ridiculously focused one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T13:10:42-08:00","id":1016697,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Perverseness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1016540#post1016540\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dave, you've been outed. Blame RichT or Canada. Either ones good. HMMM poutin, So SO good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Er... What?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T13:27:41-08:00","id":1016711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1016697#post1016697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Er... What?</div> </div> </div> </div>Referencing the comments section of yesterday's Monday Meeting Notes where Rich essentially just reiterated that you're the game dev.<br /> <br /> I have no idea why they're being a weirdo about this non-revelation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T14:28:43-08:00","id":1016737,"title":"","content":"Although I understand the decision of focusing on the general template rather than the process, (It's a lot less work) I would still like to see some influence or consequences on your character depending on the process.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T03:58:37-08:00","id":1016976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1016737#post1016737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Although I understand the decision of focusing on the general template rather than the process, (It's a lot less work) I would still like to see some influence or consequences on your character depending on the process.</div> </div> </div> </div>DaveB's description of Clades as &quot;divergence-agnostic&quot; makes me wonder if &quot;divergence&quot; is going to be an in-game term, which means you're not entirely without hope of that - though as it's not &quot;Divergence-agnostic,&quot; I figure it won't be a mechanical thing if it is. I guess some Variations and Scars will make more sense for some remaking processes than others. But where I really suspect remaking process will matter is in the characterisation of conspiracies - if a conspiracy the group that made a Deviant, then how they made her is almost certainly reflected in what else they're capable of and how they operate - and even if they didn't make her, if they're hunting her, it's because they think they can make use of her, and they're more likely to think that about a Deviant whose remaking process parallels what they're good at.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-16T18:57:58-08:00","id":1018291,"title":"","content":"Can a Deviant have a parasite or symbiote with its own mind and personality as the source of his Variations and Scars?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T14:49:22-08:00","id":1018593,"title":"","content":"Every game line has some stories to illustrate what the characters are like. Presumably we'll get official ones in the Deviant book, but until then here's VOX POP, my own seasonal take on Deviants. Please note that I wrote this before the election.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://1drv.ms/w/s!AqCV5zih4HTHhSrtc028zo0dlqi0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://1drv.ms/w/s!AqCV5zih4HTHhSrtc028zo0dlqi0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://1drv.ms/w/s!AqCV5zih4HTHhSrtc028zo0dlqi0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://1drv.ms/w/s!AqCV5zih4HTHhSrtc028zo0dlqi0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1430-gareth3","name":"Gareth3","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-19T13:23:52-08:00","id":1019398,"title":"","content":"If Hellboy is a Deviant, does that mean his Blowout Mode summons the Ogdru Jahad? What about Deviants like Captain America? What would their Blowout Modes be like?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-19T13:35:25-08:00","id":1019405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1019398#post1019398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If Hellboy is a Deviant, does that mean his Blowout Mode summons the Ogdru Jahad? What about Deviants like Captain America? What would their Blowout Modes be like?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think Blowout modes exist for specific powers. From what was said &quot;blowout&quot; is more like &quot;Get powers/Variations until your humanity suffers critical failure&quot;. If I understand what's been stated so far correctly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-19T17:42:08-08:00","id":1019518,"title":"","content":"I'm now wondering if &quot;Because of experiments, you now have super human strength and durability but you have to eat people or become weak and anemic&quot; is a viable deviant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm an aspergic individual. This means that I can't imagine how others will react to situations. This has led to me accidentally offending someone, and has also led to me being less clear in statements than I thought I was. I'd like to apologize, and ask that others don't get mad, but just ask me to reword or clarify. Thank you","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","name":"Rater202","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-19T18:01:11-08:00","id":1019528,"title":"","content":"I'm dearly hoping we can get a historical setting as a stretch goal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-19T21:18:43-08:00","id":1019601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1019528#post1019528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm dearly hoping we can get a historical setting as a stretch goal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given that Beast got one and got a Mortal Remains Chapter years after the book was published, I see no reason this will not happen for Deviant too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><spa