m. </span></span></span><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh that's not from Guyver. That's from Shin Kamen Rider: Prologue.<br /> <br /> Not that I would begrudge you for that: the art direction and the special effects used are very similar between the two.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T22:28:26-07:00","id":1130720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1130717#post1130717\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh that's not from Guyver. That's from Shin Kamen Rider: Prologue.<br /> <br /> Not that I would begrudge you for that: the art direction and the special effects used are very similar between the two.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, more like <i>Guyver looking</i> than actual Guyver. He's not going to be firing gravity wells out of his chest or anything like that. But that bug man video does seem more appropriate, thank you.<br /> <br /> As for the others, I hardly think being strapped down to an autopsy table, <i>while alive,</i> is considered 'trashy'. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 08-18-2017, 09:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T04:57:48-07:00","id":1130776,"title":"","content":"Just watched the official video of Monster by Skillet, tell me the video doesn't remind you Deviant.<br /> <br /> Dude wakes up a slab after weird surgury, and then escapes the facility with people chasing him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 08-18-2017, 08:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T09:00:28-07:00","id":1130844,"title":"","content":"<b>Phantom Pregnancy:</b> A woman accidentally loses her baby in utero and discovers she has ghostly powers. Turns out her child didn't know where to go after its death, so it stayed where it felt safest.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>The Singularity:</b> While testing a prototype neural interface technology, a catastrophic power surge results in the beta testers' minds being separated from their bodies. Now they're trapped in cyberspace, battling Angels and Demons from the inside out!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Das Ubermensch:</b> In an effort to bio-engineer the perfect human soldier, a team of discredited scientists mixed a genetic cocktail of Giant, Fae and Werewolf blood, which they forcefully spliced into a human test subject. Now, they have a very strong, very handsome and very angry escapee hunting down everybody involved in the project.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>50% Off Deal:</b> In an amazing stroke of luck, a demon botched on setting the proper terms for a soul pact and ended up with only half the mortal's soul. Instead of being able to fully possess their new vessel, they were only able to funnel a portion of their essence into them, transforming the mortal into a half demon!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T09:08:10-07:00","id":1130846,"title":"","content":"Come to think of it, wouldn't the Merrick Institute make for good Deviants?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T09:12:49-07:00","id":1130847,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It\u2019s this Conviction and Loyalty that drives them, replacing their former Virtues and Vices. </div> </div> </div>This is interesting. The V/V analogues are the same as the Integritype stats themselves - that's new, right?<br /> <br /> The more balanced analogues are interesting too.<br /> <br /> And it does indeed seem that Origin and Clade are two X-splats, in the sense that the other games use them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T11:10:09-07:00","id":1130895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1130776#post1130776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just watched the official video of Monster by Skillet, tell me the video doesn't remind you Deviant.<br /> <br /> Dude wakes up a slab after weird surgury, and then escapes the facility with people chasing him.</div> </div> </div> </div>I raise you:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=saZVNLMMmmo\" target=\"_blank\">The Chemical Brothers - Sometimes I Feel So Deserted</a><br /> <br /> Scars and Variations in action. Also, people chasing people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T11:23:20-07:00","id":1130904,"title":"","content":"5. Psionic abilities run strong in your family; they've been cultivating them for centuries. And now after countless generations of carefully selected breeding, they've produced you. One of the most talented psychics in the family's collective history. It wouldn't be so bad, if your family wasn't obsessed with power. They don't see you as their relative, they see you as an asset to be used and exploited. You couldn't stomach it anymore, so you ran away from home. That's when your parents put out a reward for your 'safe' return![/QUOTE]<br /> <br /> <br /> Love this so very much","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5118-perverseness","name":"Perverseness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T11:27:45-07:00","id":1130906,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Nyrufa;n1130844]<b>Phantom Pregnancy:</b> A woman accidentally loses her baby in utero and discovers she has ghostly powers. Turns out her child didn't know where to go after its death, so it stayed where it felt safest.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Ok, this is great. Both touchingly warm hearted and deeply damned creepy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5118-perverseness","name":"Perverseness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T15:48:21-07:00","id":1130996,"title":"","content":"This announcement makes me want to break out my blu-ray of From Beyond this weekend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13933-the-running-halfling","name":"The Running Halfling","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T17:03:33-07:00","id":1131015,"title":"","content":"I wonder if Touchstones will be more of the focus, rather than the ''theme/mood'' style anchors of the other gamelines. After all, your Conviction can be focused on your progenitors, wile your loyalty can be devoted to whomever you choose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T17:29:18-07:00","id":1131026,"title":"","content":"For Deviant-making possibilities, there was a thread in Hunter forum about how hunter groups might cock up and create Deviants: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1023945-hunter-made-deviants\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-made-deviants</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T05:24:55-07:00","id":1131202,"title":"","content":"Sadly, I know virtually nothing about Hunter.<br /> <br /> <br /> -----------------------------------<br /> <br /> <b>Living Hell:</b> Research into the forces of undeath has discovered the secret of immortality, a scientifically approved way of self resurrection. Unfortunately, the procedure seems to be uncontrollable, causing the body to resurrect itself after <i>every death</i>; regardless if the subject actually wants to die. During clinical trials, one test subject manages to escape their facility after enduring dozens of fatal experiments. Now, the escaped subject plans to destroy any trace of their research before they condemn anyone else to endless misery; or worse, auction their secrets to the wrong hands.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Land Shark:</b> A marine biologist is bitten by a radioactive shark and begins to manifest strange abilities 24 hours later. After recovering from their injuries, their focus has shifted to those responsible for polluting the shark's habitat and ensuring a permanent end to their careless dumping policies.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Conscience Made Manifest:</b> A man's body becomes a host to two simultaneous cases of possession, one being a demon and the other being an angel. As far as any of them can tell, the procedure seems to be irreversible at the moment. The two ethereals are too busy fighting one another to fully dominate his body, leaving him with the power to choose which side to listen to. But with every choice, the respective side becomes a little bit stronger.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Free the Beast: </b> An occult driven scientist has discovered a way to bring out a person's inner monster by tapping into the most atavistic parts of their genome. Through the use of gene manipulation, they have been turning human test subjects into abominations. Before the process could be fully completed, one of his test subjects manages to escape from the lab and swears revenge upon the mad doctor for the inhumane experiments performed on him.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 08-19-2017, 08:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T08:21:35-07:00","id":1131280,"title":"","content":"<b>The Undying Hand of Steel:</b> You were raised by the monks of the Heavenly City since you were a child, and they taught you the secrets of the Hand of Steel to make you their protector. However, before you have completed your training, you run away to New York City to seek out the person who killed your parents and left you an orphan. Not only are your pursued by the monks, who seek to have you return to the Heavenly City, but you have also sworn to oppose the Order of the Fist, which has its fingers in almost every criminal enterprise in the city.<br /> <br /> <b>The Database:</b> You were just a regular guy, working tech support for a big box retail store, when you unexpectedly had the sum total of all US intelligence data. The NSA and CIA have...<i>encouraged</i> you to work for them until they can remove it, in exchange for other groups looking to get control of the Database.<br /> <br /> <b>The Gentry:</b> You were alone in the park one night, when you were taken by a man with a forked tongue and the eyes of a serpent. He took you to a strange place of terror and wonder, where you were made into the favorite slave of the Lord of that place. One night, or day, you could never tell the time there, your Keeper was attacked by a rival, and in the confusion you fled, all the way back home. Your body and spirit shredded, you returned a monster made of wood and rivets, hidden under a mask of humanity. You have foundrefuge with other escapees, but you must remain ever aware in case the Serpent Man returns.<br /> <br /> <b>Homeworld:</b> Ever since you had been born, the mysterious gemstone affixed to your navel, bequeathed by your mother, has stubbornly refused to reveal its secrets. As you grew, you slowly unlocked its powers with the help of your mother's comrades. It's a good thing, too, as the forces of your mother's home planet have begun to turn an eye to Earth once again, threatening to reignite the war your mother started all those centuries ago, with the opponent even more powerful and well-equipped than ever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T08:43:19-07:00","id":1131289,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mal