, has stubbornly refused to reveal its secrets. As you grew, you slowly unlocked its powers with the help of your mother's comrades. It's a good thing, too, as the forces of your mother's home planet have begun to turn an eye to Earth once again, threatening to reignite the war your mother started all those centuries ago, with the opponent even more powerful and well-equipped than ever.</div> </div> </div> </div>1 iron fist<br /> 2 a flim i heard of <br /> 3 changeling<br /> 4 there's a template for that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13426-ameraaaaaa","name":"Ameraaaaaa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T08:52:32-07:00","id":1131293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1131289#post1131289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1 iron fist<br /> 2 a flim i heard of<br /> 3 changeling<br /> 4 there's a template for that</div> </div> </div> </div>2) Actually, I was knocking off the TV series Chuck.<br /> <br /> 4) I was not aware of that. What template is that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"user