lt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>Omg yes","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-16T08:18:58-07:00","id":1140812,"title":"","content":"Huh... I was told cats actually had poor eye sight, which is why their whiskers grow so long.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTSSogB9nyS_Xf8G1Ew_RQtTWpLsduypTXEz0Due5-QpR2Dq9Gn\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-16T08:45:45-07:00","id":1140820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1140812#post1140812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh... I was told cats actually had poor eye sight, which is why their whiskers grow so long.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTSSogB9nyS_Xf8G1Ew_RQtTWpLsduypTXEz0Due5-QpR2Dq9Gn\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>Then that could be a scar but how do the whiskers help another scar could be that he's eyes are claily catlike but contact lenses still work and maybe he has fer maybe purs to talk to cat's other scars are welcome","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13426-ameraaaaaa","name":"Ameraaaaaa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-16T09:25:46-07:00","id":1140839,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1394_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1394\" data-vbnamecard=\"1394\">Nyrufa</a> less about &quot;poor eyesight&quot; more bout &quot;poor peripheral vision&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-17T04:49:14-07:00","id":1141018,"title":"","content":"Oh i see wow who knew making a cat girl damn it why did i have to make it based on a animal well still useing to use it but what about someone who can teleport the problem is there's already an merit for that in hurt locker 1 last thing i want to make someone with a poison skin but how deadly would the poison be to justify having it on all the time like Toxicity 5 maybe 10","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13426-ameraaaaaa","name":"Ameraaaaaa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-17T15:06:08-07:00","id":1141222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1140771#post1140771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What would a Blowout look like?</div> </div> </div> </div>Like The Birds, but with cats. First they'll tear your enemies apart - but as they do so, your body will break apart as your life essence flows into them through the cracks in yuor soul, and your blood and flesh trail out to meld with them. When it's over, your enemies will be little but bones and scattered gore, and the cats will return to their hearths - most sleek and satisfied, but perhaps a few of them ill for a while - and you will be gone as if you had never been, though your last thought will have been a purr of savage satisfaction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-17T18:37:31-07:00","id":1141272,"title":"","content":"So, any speculations about what the Y Splats will be like? I'm guessing they will be about how your pursue your revenge and balance your Conviction/Loyalty. Kinda like Changeling Courts, but less about fables/emotions and more about activism/tactics. I can imagine a Y splat about Deviants who look at the freakish but amazing things they can do, and decide to study their own condition so they can master it and maybe even use it to improve society. Sorta like the Ordo Dracul.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 09-17-2017, 09:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-17T22:58:02-07:00","id":1141326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1140820#post1140820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Then that could be a scar but how do the whiskers help another scar could be that he's eyes are claily catlike but contact lenses still work and maybe he has fer maybe purs to talk to cat's other scars are welcome</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Cat whiskers act as sensory receivers that allow them to detect what is present around them. I don't claim to know the specifics, but I imagine it has something to do with sensing vibrations. That's why it's so difficult to sneak up on a cat without alerting them, even if you're as quiet as possible.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1141018#post1141018\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh i see wow who knew making a cat girl damn it why did i have to make it based on a animal well still useing to use it but what about someone who can teleport the problem is there's already an merit for that in hurt locker 1 last thing i want to make someone with a poison skin but how deadly would the poison be to justify having it on all the time like Toxicity 5 maybe 10</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Maybe wanna add some punctuation there, buddy? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> The thing is that right now, we don't know the full extend of what powers a Deviant will have. But they fall somewhere in the middle range between a minion splat (Ghouls, Wolfblooded, Faetouched, est) and a master splat (Vampires, Werewolves, Changelings, est). They're stronger than your run of the mill canon fodder, but they aren't as powerful as most of the other main splats. And their powers often come with hefty consequences for abusing them.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm not going to say teleportation isn't a possibility, but I would imagine that one of the possible scars would be... well... <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NH-8L1iZq20\" target=\"_blank\">Something like this</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-18-2017, 02:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T01:08:58-07:00","id":1141341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1141326#post1141326\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cat whiskers act as sensory receivers that allow them to detect what is present around them. I don't claim to know the specifics, but I imagine it has something to do with sensing vibrations. That's why it's so difficult to sneak up on a cat without alerting them, even if you're as quiet as possible.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's hard to sneak up on cats because to them we're basically huge clumsy gorillas that can't take a silent step to save our lives; the whiskers work in order to see to which opening they can get thru without becoming stuck: they aren't insect-like antennae.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T15:51:23-07:00","id":1144548,"title":"","content":"not sure if it's been suggested before but I recently came to the conclusion Danny Phantom would be a pretty good example for a Deviant Chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12235-emmens","name":"emmens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-28T06:58:08-07:00","id":1144747,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/one-of-a-kind-deviant-the-renegades/\" target=\"_blank\">New blog post</a> from Dave on Deviant's design goals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-28T07:40:51-07:00","id":1144761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1144747#post1144747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/one-of-a-kind-deviant-the-renegades/\" target=\"_blank\">New blog post</a> from Dave on Deviant's design goals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sweet Christmas! I saw it already and didn't have time to post, but I am even more excited for Deviant now. Its also going to be really interesting to have Deviant paired with Mage in Dark Eras 2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-28T07:47:24-07:00","id":1144763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1130556#post1130556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Here\u2019s something I don\u2019t think we\u2019ve spoken about anywhere \u2013 at some point between now and </span></span></span><b>Deviant</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> being released, dedicated Chronicles readers will see a ruleset we\u2019ve been working on across several gamelines over the last few years for organization-level play. In the book they\u2019re coming in first, they\u2019re used for player-controlled groups, treating them almost as characters. </span></span></span><b>Deviant</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> will use them, but for the </span></span></span><i>antagonists</i><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">.</span></span></span> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">What this means is that the conspiracy hunting Deviant characters will have a character sheet of its own, filled out by the Storyteller from facts established by player choices in character creation and collaborative questions. The more Variations a Remade character has (and how powerful they are) is a key factor in how many points the Storyteller has to spend on their Conspiracy, and multiple players can pool their Conspiracy creation together.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In <b>Deviant</b>\u2018s Storytelling chapter we\u2019ll have an optional system (in so much as the ST can override it at any time) for determining the Conspiracy\u2019s \u201cactions\u201d in response to what the player characters do in a Story, how active the Conspiracy is in hunting them, and other factors determined by the Conspiracy\u2019s \u201cstats\u201d. This isn\u2019t new ground for rpgs in general, but for a Chronicles of Darkness game we haven\u2019t tried it before.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Here's a thing that just <i>leapt </i>out at me from the blog post. I mean, we know about Conspiracies being actual constructed characters as antagonists for Deviant, but the idea of them being used for player-controlled groups, and those rules coming out <i>first</i>, that's a huge surprise and something I'm very much going to be looking forward to. Especially considering it's something that I've been tinkering with ever since I got into Mummy and made an attempt at converting it to 2E.<br /> <br /> Any bets as to which books these rules will be printed in? My guess is it will be Signs of Sorcery, Book of the Pentacle, or Hunter 2E.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-28T09:34:48-07:00","id":1144815,"title":"","content":"I'd be surprised if it was in Signs of Sorcery, we've already seen the outline of it.<br /> <br /> I'd guess Hunter second edition or the Demon Night Horrors book.<br /> <br /> Was hoping we'd get a full book on cults and criminal syndicates but hopefully this will do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-28T10:48:10-07:00","id":1144836,"title":"","content":"Cross-posting from my comment on the blog:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I\u2019m really, really interested in Deviant, I adore how modular it sounds, and trimming down on complexity is always a strong selling point for me. I will say though, as a result of this extreme modularity, I\u2019m having a very difficult time formulating a mental image of what Deviant will look like. Not in terms of story, I think the their narrative role is very well-fleshed out and clear, but on a system level, I\u2019m struggling to grokk it. There are so many variables that depend on other variables, most of which are highly customizable, it\u2019s just a little overwhelming. Exciting in equal measure, don\u2019t get me wrong. I\u2019m more excited for this game than I have been for any other new Chronicles line. But I can\u2019t quite fit the idea of it into my head. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 09-28-2017, 01:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-28T11:02:04-07:00","id":1144845,"title":"","content":"I think it's going to seem a lot like changeling mixed with demon. Changeling really allowed you to appear as any other supernatural, from Frankenstein monsterss to vampires, but unless you delved heavily into making your own Contracts the limits were pretty superficial. Demon does allow for a lot of mix and match, though it doesn't seem to be as modular as Deviant is aiming at.<br /> <br /> Looking forward to it, regardless. Makes me think of Mutants and Masterminds a bit. Fun power-building systems there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-28T11:31:45-07:00","id":1144863,"title":"","content":"I thought I'd gotten kinda tired of CofD, but Deviant has re-sparked my interest. As someone whose games have increasingly eschewed system and structure, the focus on customization and simplicity is music to my ears. I've had my fingers crossed since Hurt Locker introduced merit based templates that CofD would lean in that direction.<br /> <br /> Now I just need to find a way to mash this up with Ascension and I'll have one super-system for wizards and their spawn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-28T16:38:38-07:00","id":1145007,"title":"","content":"I am very interested in how Forms work, especially since it meantions Symbiotes as being a Form. Probably Cyborgs too?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | 