","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13426-ameraaaaaa","name":"Ameraaaaaa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-03T09:55:40-07:00","id":1146365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1144763#post1144763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[/SIZE][/FONT][/COLOR][/SIZE][/FONT][/COLOR]<br /> <br /> Here's a thing that just <i>leapt </i>out at me from the blog post. I mean, we know about Conspiracies being actual constructed characters as antagonists for Deviant, but the idea of them being used for player-controlled groups, and those rules coming out <i>first</i>, that's a huge surprise and something I'm very much going to be looking forward to. Especially considering it's something that I've been tinkering with ever since I got into Mummy and made an attempt at converting it to 2E.<br /> <br /> Any bets as to which books these rules will be printed in? My guess is it will be Signs of Sorcery, Book of the Pentacle, or Hunter 2E.</div> </div> </div> </div>Could be Cults for Mummy 2E.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank