 Cults for Mummy 2E.</div> </div> </div> </div>That makes the most sense to me too, but that would mean Mummy 2E would be done before Deviant even comes out, which doesn't seem very likely to me. Hunter 2E would make sense as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-03T19:12:24-07:00","id":1146521,"title":"","content":"Idunno. Mummy is getting a retooling; Deviant is being made from scratch. Even with Deviant development getting a head start, I could see Mummy 2e being released first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-04T06:09:22-07:00","id":1146642,"title":"","content":"Hard to say, apparently Geist 2e had been in secret development for a year or two before they announced it and it's going as the most heavily changed book from 1st to 2nd edition, it's possible Mummy might follow a similar path since they said they wanted to make it more accessible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5557-runcible","name":"Runcible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5557_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-04T20:58:34-07:00","id":1146898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Runcible</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1146642#post1146642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hard to say, apparently Geist 2e had been in secret development for a year or two before they announced it and it's going as the most heavily changed book from 1st to 2nd edition, it's possible Mummy might follow a similar path since they said they wanted to make it more accessible.</div> </div> </div> </div>Geist2e is STILL mostly a secret: been in development for awhile but not a single peep of a dev blog anywhere.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"useri