a bit, but the end is the same. The only thing that matters is what you do with the time you have left. For my deviant that is making sure that what was done to him doesn't happen to anyone else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-01T07:48:42-08:00","id":1164264,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1163968#post1163968\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's as much Acceptance as a Deviant can have; exchanging a self-destructive coping mechanism for a more positive one. If they try to go without one entirely, they go Brindlefly.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm getting BoJack Horseman flashbacks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-01T13:32:44-08:00","id":1164371,"title":"","content":"I see a few &quot;end games&quot; for Deviant. Not literally End Games but more higher levels of play:<br /> - The Conspiracy has been taken apart piece by piece. <br /> - The creation of a New Conspiracy to hunt down Conspiracies (or make more like you)<br /> - The ending to AKIRA.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-05T03:22:38-08:00","id":1165266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1149989#post1149989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could she be a deviant herself though, defining herself by her ability to preserve life and making her creator proud? She definitely has visible Scars</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I forgot to mention that before performing her surgery on people, she modifies her own body with 4 additional arms because her work is too complex to do with just two limbs. As far as I can tell, she removes these arms when she's not operating on people.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1164231#post1164231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's kind of tragic that the best the deviant can hope for is some sort of inner balance before he eventually succumbs to their scars, but at the same time, that's what makes the game so attractive to me. You're doomed no matter what, a ticking time bomb, you can delay it a bit, but the end is the same. The only thing that matters is what you do with the time you have left. For my deviant that is making sure that what was done to him doesn't happen to anyone else.</div> </div> </div> </div>That premise gives me <i>Changeling: the Dreaming</i> vibes. Your character was pretty much slated for a slow, tragic decline into madness (or worse) over time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-05-2017, 06:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T19:05:11-08:00","id":1166878,"title":"","content":"The Monday Meeting Notes from tonight indicates Dave has a co-developer for Deviant. <br /> <br /> Has the name of this person been released?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T08:49:45-08:00","id":1167006,"title":"","content":"I don't for the corebook, but I do for the gameline - it's like the way Demon was shared by Rose and Matt McFarland, but Matt Developed the Demon corebook himself, and then they alternated on sourcebooks.<br /> <br /> It's partly a formalization of what we've seen over the last couple of games, where stretchgoals the corebook Developer is too busy to do often end up getting done by a nominated person - Danielle for Beast, for example.<br /> <br /> My co-&quot;line&quot;-Dev is one of the major writers for Deviant, and I am happy in the knowledge that they're poised to take over whatever I can't do, so that Mage can go back to being my main priority when they clash.<br /> <br /> And yes, this was my idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T11:19:33-08:00","id":1167054,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https: