o you think prometheans would try to make deviants human again in soul?</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine some very well might. The related empathy gaps on both sides and almost inevitable mutual envy could make for fascinating conflict. Think the supernatural equivalent of a friend who &quot;knows how to fix you&quot;.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24176-borne","name":"Borne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24176_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T16:39:06-07:00","id":1214828,"title":"","content":"I'm so excited for this game, I can barely stand it. There are <i>endless</i> possibilities for Deviants! Right now I really want to see how I could make a &quot;psychic super-solder&quot; type of character, and I bet the tools are there...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12970-gellydog","name":"Gellydog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12970_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T16:52:31-07:00","id":1214838,"title":"","content":"I'm hoping for a symbiote style character a la venom. The idea of the human morality at odds with an alien one is just too cool","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Membe