heonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T19:45:24-07:00","id":1234854,"title":"","content":"I mean, maybe. You have as much access to information about this game as I do. I'm just confused why you keep bringing up this one concept. As you've said, you'd need to play up the negative aspects of Bast(et) for this character to fit the setting. At that point, once you have part of your soul replaced with a mythic being of questionable morality, Beast just seems a better fit. This is especially so given that it is &quot;the crossover splat&quot; so you can tie-in to Mummy more easily.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24176,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24176-borne","user":"Borne","date":".  Clarified. 07-13-2018, 11:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24176-borne","name":"Borne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24176_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T07:38:34-07:00","id":1234949,"title":"","content":"Alright then have a Yeerklike creature in your Head?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T10:47:17-07:00","id":1235005,"title":"","content":"Something in that vein. They were rather cryptic about symbiotes/parasites during the Venom discussion, so I have no idea if it would be Amalgam or the mystery splat. Not quite a yeerk though, playing a controller would just be either role-playing the yeerk, or screaming inarticulately at an Actual Play of someone else role-playing a yeerk. Taylor could be the basis for a terrifying Loyalist antagonist however.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24176-borne","name":"Borne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24176_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T11:55:53-07:00","id":1235033,"title":"","content":"There was this animorphs fanfiction I was reading about a yeerk sciencetist trying to genentic engineering stronger Humen host bodies , and acidently had it so the human was the one in control <a href=\"https://www.fanfiction.net/s/9598883/1/Insurrection\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.fanfiction.net/s/9598883/1/Insurrection</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","user":"Konradleijon","date":".  Spell fix 07-14-2018, 03:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-19T03:35:31-07:00","id":1236712,"title":"","content":"Would it be a good idea to make a thread to collect people's various Deviant concepts? Obviously as more info about the game comes out and eventually publication occurs, ideas can get refined to use the appropriate terms and mechanics.","signature":""