gades/947212-deviant-the-renegades?p=1260817#post1260817\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do the different clades have different ways of showing conviction and loyalty? How would a deviant who knew exactly what he was getting into, but not the full extent of consequences, react with conviction and loyalty knowing it's his fault</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, for a start, that's an Origin, not a Clade, so<br /> <br /> Edit: But yes, Origin's mechanical effect is to tweak your starting dots and touchstones of the two traits","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":14,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","user":"Dave Brookshaw","date":". 10-17-2018, 09:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-17T07:28:15-07:00","id":1261111,"title":"","content":"Ahh ok, thanks for elaborating","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-17T15:24:12-07:00","id":1261186,"title":"","content":"Can Clades also affect touchstones or Conviction/Loyalty?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24176-borne","name":"Borne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24176_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T10:03:57-07:00","id":1261316,"title":"","content":"My read of the forums is that Clades mechanically focus on the Variations (powers) of the Remade, while the Origin interacts with touchstones and Conviction/Loyalty","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T10:46:25-07:00","id":1261327,"title":"","content":"Will Remade have any particular ease or difficulty connecting with the Realms Invisible compared to regular people? Or is that something that would come down to each individual Remade?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T16:54:53-07:00","id":1261432,"title":"","content":"Given that powers are heavily customizable, I'd lean towards the latter. However, I wonder how their broken souls interact with Urging Ephemerals.<br /> <br /> That said, I am certain that whatever abilities they have to interact with Ephemerals, they will not be safe and very probably not reliable.","signature":"<hr clas